.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Call about the home you like. One of our agents will go over the HOA's rules and the costs with you. Office hours are Monday to Friday 9 to 6 and Saturday 10 to 4.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call an agent</a></div></section></main>
