ny seen from a plane over the ocean. Photo: U.S. Geological Survey, <a href="https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. Geological Survey</a>.</div><div role="listitem">Chapter3 Realty resized these photos and cropped some of them.</div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/buyers/gated-communities/tidewater-plantation-marsh-from-above-2023-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/buyers/gated-communities/tidewater-plantation-marsh-from-above-2023-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":900,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"Tidewater Plantation from above, with its golf holes along the inlet labelled","caption":"Tidewater Plantation from above, with its golf holes along the inlet labelled. Houses line the street above the fairways.","description":"Tidewater Plantation from above, labelled: golf fairways along the tidal water behind Cherry Grove Inlet, houses above them, and canal homes at the lower right; labels: Golf holes along the inlet and Tidewater Plantation","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP"},"creditText":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP, public domain, via The National Map (USGS)","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP)","license":"https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/","acquireLicensePage":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","isBasedOn":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"Tidewater Plantation, North Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/buyers/gated-communities/prestwick-course-from-above-2023-1200w