-brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">2025 retiree moving study</a>, <a href="https://www.flsenate.gov/Laws/Statutes/2025/553.899" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Florida inspection law</a>, <a href="https://insurify.com/homeowners-insurance/states/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">home insurance averages by state and city</a>. We are not tax advisers; rates change and your situation decides the answer. Verify with a professional before you plan around any of it.</p></div></section>
