-<section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">What the sale buys</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">What a Massachusetts sale buys at the coast</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A typical Massachusetts home costs about $669,000 on the statewide Zillow average, against about $342,000 here, on the same July 2026 measure: close to double, the widest spread of any state page we publish. Greater Boston averages more than that statewide number. Sell near the average there, buy near the average here, and the difference funds the move, the furniture and a margin that changes what retirement looks like. See how much further every dollar goes here compared with your hometown on the <a href="/buyers/relocating/cost-of-living/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">cost of living calculator</a>.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px">The coast itself will look structurally familiar: <a href="/submarkets/surfside-beach/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Surfside Beach</a> and <a href="/submarkets/garden-city/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Garden City</a> run on compact ocean-block grids of cottages and beach houses, <a href="/submarkets/pawleys-island/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Pawleys Island</a> pairs historic cottages with creek docks, and <a href="/submarkets/north-myrtle-beach/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">North Myrtle Beach</a> adds the wide-beach neighborhoods. The water is warmer for longer, which the <a href="/buyers/relocating/weather/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">weather page</a> shows month by month, and the <a href="/buyers/relocating/which-town/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">town by town page</a> compares all ten areas.</p></div></section>
