-<div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/">Buyers</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/relocating/">Relocating</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Getting Around</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Planes, roads and the bus</p><h1 class="detail-h1">Getting around Myrtle Beach:<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">learn these four road names first.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated ${bylineDate}</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Drive times between Grand Strand towns, the Myrtle Beach airport with ten airlines and nonstop service to more than 50 cities, summer traffic, the bus, and the I-73 project.</p><div style="margin-top:1.8rem;display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="#lead-form">Ask a local</a><a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call 854.333.2135</a></div></div></div>
